# napi build artifacts (built per-platform in CI, not committed)
*.node
# The type file `napi build --dts ignore.d.ts` generates from the Rust surface; `index.d.ts` is the
# hand-maintained public one (it also types the AsyncClient wrapper), so the generated file is parked
# here and never shipped (`files` in package.json names what ships).
ignore.d.ts
# `npm pack` output and the artifacts directory `napi artifacts` consumes in the publish lane.
*.tgz
artifacts/
